<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμῠλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not ground at the mill:</i>
			hence, <i>of the finest meal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					6.72
				</span></i>
			; cf. foreg. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυλος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>cake of fine meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1092
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				1195
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				2D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				9.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				32
			</span></i>:— also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυλον, τό,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.647f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυλον, τό,</span>
			<i>starch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				18.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1171.11
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Lebena</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1088i5
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
